DOCUMENT: Maharashtra Legal Metrology (Enforcement) Amendment Rules, 2021
AUTHORITY: Maharashtra Government
JURISDICTION: MAHARASHTRA
NOTIFICATION NUMBER: M-LM-2021/CR-105
EFFECTIVE DATE: 2021-09-01
OFFICIAL URL: https://legalmetrology.maharashtra.gov.in/sites/default/files/Maha_Amendment_2021.pdf

SECTION 1: Short title, extent and commencement.
(1) This Act/Rule may be called Maharashtra Legal Metrology (Enforcement) Amendment Rules, 2021.
(2) It extends to the whole of MAHARASHTRA.

RULE 6: Declarations to be made on every package.
(1) Every package shall bear thereon or on label securely affixed thereto detailed declarations including:
(a) Name and address of manufacturer, packer, or importer.
(b) Common or generic name of commodity.
(c) Net quantity in terms of standard weight or measure.
(d) Month and year of packing or import.
(e) Maximum Retail Price (MRP) inclusive of all taxes.
(f) Consumer helpline details.

RULE 14: Periodical verification and stamping of weights and measures.
(1) Every person using weight or measure in commercial transaction shall present it for verification and stamping to the Legal Metrology Officer.